config AIC8800M80X2P_WLAN_SUPPORT
	tristate "AIC8800M80X2P WiFi support"
	depends on PCI && CFG80211
	help
	  This is support for AIC8800M80X2P WiFi driver.
	  It supports AICSemi AIC8800M80X2P based PCIe wireless
	  network adapters.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called aic8800_fdrv_m80x2p.

